max — your personal MAX for agents and scripts. Reads go to a local store; search, review and tasks
work offline.

Usage: max <profile> <command> [options]
Account commands start with your profile, a name you choose; none is ever assumed.

What you can do:
  review 'date>1d' --unanswered 4h  questions to you nobody answered, across every chat
  tasks list                        questions and promises waiting on you
  search all "invoice"              messages, notes, file text and voice transcripts at once
  contacts context <person>         shared chats and the last messages each way
  schedule agent …                  an agent on a timer that reads and drafts, never sends
  bot messages send <chat>          your bot, through MAX's official Bot API
  MAX_READ_ONLY=1 max …             an agent that can never send

Works with:
  tg                                Telegram in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  wa                                WhatsApp in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  zm                                Zoom meetings: transcripts and summaries, searchable with your messages
  drive                             Google Drive and Docs as local text, searchable with your messages
  memo context <person>             one person across messengers, mail, notes and meetings

Start here:   max personal setup  (any profile name works)
              max account list    your profiles and their logged-in accounts
Next:         max commands        every command, by section
              max guide           scenarios: command sequences for common tasks
              max help options    output, offline, timeouts, dry run
For agents:   max skill show      rules and the discovery loop
